        (property "Description" "TI DRV8874-Q1 automotive (AEC-Q100) integrated N-channel H-bridge brushed-DC motor driver: 4.5-37 V VM, 6 A peak, 100 mOhm typ per FET, charge pump for 100 % duty, IPROPI current-mirror output (450 uA/A) with VREF/ITRIP current regulation, PH/EN or PWM or independent half-bridge control (PMODE strap), IMODE strap selecting retry vs latched-off OCP and nFAULT reporting of chopping, UVLO/CPUV/OCP/TSD. Tier-1 brushed bridge of docs/OpenSecureESC-Brushed-Specifications.md; first instance builds/6s/10A/BRUSHED_CAN_485_isolation/ (Serenity-UAV nacelle-tilt gearmotor, 2.9 A stall). The non-automotive DRV8874 [62] is pin-identical in the same package." (at 0 0 0)
