        (property "Description" "TI TPS54560B 4.5-60 V input, 5 A step-down DC/DC converter with Eco-mode, peak-current-mode control, 100 kHz-2.5 MHz fixed frequency (RT/CLK), internal soft-start, cycle-by-cycle current limit, adjustable UVLO, 0.8 V reference, 8-pin HSOIC PowerPAD (DDA). Motor/solenoid rail buck (6-7 V from the 6S branch, 22.2-25.2 V) of builds/6s/10A/BRUSHED_CAN_485_isolation/." (at 0 0 0)
          (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)
